spDNS is derived from scDNS and retains its original network-divergence and
cell-contribution framework.

Original project: https://github.com/HChaoLab/scDNS
Original author: Chao Huang
Original citation supplied by scDNS:
"scDNS: Characterizing Gene Perturbations in Single Cells via Network
Divergence Analysis." (2025).

spDNS adaptations:
- integration of SF expression and event PSI;
- per-SF transformation of expression to a 0-1 scale;
- strict directed SF-to-event topology;
- directed bipartite degree-preserving randomization; and
- SF-focused node-level and cell-level interpretation.

The original scDNS mathematical methods are retained and are not claimed as
new inventions of spDNS.
